!!! oculus/window-focus.mat
!!! Focus tracking for the scene.
!!!
!!! Focus is canonical scene state — where attention currently rests.
!!! This is not focus discovery or arbitration; it is the recorded
!!! position of focus in the current revision.

book oculus.window.focus

read everything from ny.lang.core

public focus-position begin choice
    when Focused
    when Unfocused
end choice
